<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dagestan</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Dagestan is a mountainous region on the western shore of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caspian-sea">Caspian Sea</a> in the northeastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caucasus">Caucasus</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nader-shah">Nader Shah</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afsharid-empire">Afsharid Empire</a> campaigned there at great cost against its highland peoples. After his death in 1747, Dagestan and other Caucasian khanates threw off Iranian control.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/dagestan.jpg" alt="Dagestan" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Sobolev Alexander · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%A1%D1%83%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%BE%D0%BD.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
